    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the sample space and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8838;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;be an event. Given below are two statements:</p><p>(S1): If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p><p>(S2): If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Then</p>"
  },
